                    "sense_definition": "To shape clay into a pot or vessel on a potter's wheel.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "crafts",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "She learned how to <w>throw</w> a vase during her art class.",
